menu "eFloStop Hub"

    config APP_BENCH_DIAG
        bool "Bench diagnostics: the Wi-Fi driver's log at INFO"
        default y
        help
            wifi_manager_start() turns the Wi-Fi driver's "wifi" log tag off. With this option,
            app_wifi_start() sets it back to INFO right after, so the bench log carries the
            driver's own lines: channel switches and CSA (csa_count), station join and leave,
            and the STA's connect states. For the 2.1.4 G0 bench baseline (plan section 2.4).

            Default y during 2.1.4 development only: WP10 turns it off for the release. The
            driver prints many lines, and its connect line carries the router's SSID next to
            its BSSID.

endmenu
